        <item>
            <title>0.1.8</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in 0.1.8</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Kept active rollout checkpoints and source-index refreshes incremental, so ongoing conversations can appear without restarting the app.</li>
                    <li>Added skill attribution and cost metrics to the dashboard.</li>
                    <li>Refined dashboard window sizing and sidebar controls for a more compact layout.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
